OL,3,GNEWSAA34 south reopens Highclere-A303
OL,4,Aafter minibus fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the A34 southbound was
OL,7,Fclosed after a minibus caught fire.
OL,9,FThe road was shut between the A343 at
OL,10,FHighclere and Wash Common and the A303
OL,11,Fat Bullington on Monday night at about
OL,12,F20:40 GMT.
OL,14,FNational Highways said resurfacing work
OL,15,Fhad been completed shortly before 09:00
OL,16,Fon Tuesday and the road closure had
OL,17,Fbeen removed.
OL,19,FTraffic had been diverted off the A34
OL,20,Fat the Andover Road Interchange and on
OL,21,Fto the A343 towards Andover.
